    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/953584b88bba5effc113cdec70a3ff3d.webp?t=1748593732\" width=739 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a wild top-down shooter where influencers tried to launch the most insane viral prank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They just didn\u2019t expect one thing \u2013 <strong>you</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/daabd681b7753b1d761b35e4a8003d98.poster.avif?t=1748593732\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/daabd681b7753b1d761b35e4a8003d98.webm?t=1748593732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/daabd681b7753b1d761b35e4a8003d98.mp4?t=1748593732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Prankocalypse</strong>, social media celebs copy each other so much that, in their desperate chase for likes and subs, they\u2019ve turned into <strong>zombie-celebrities</strong>. One viral hit \u2013 hundreds of clones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/b2660388c8c72f4a1af7c5f9676bb030.poster.avif?t=1748593732\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/b2660388c8c72f4a1af7c5f9676bb030.webm?t=1748593732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/b2660388c8c72f4a1af7c5f9676bb030.mp4?t=1748593732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a supermarket security guard, you're stuck on the worst shift of your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie pranksters? Absolutely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying products and chaos? Of course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Easter eggs and absurd humor? You better believe it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Prankocalypse</strong> \u2013 a game where &quot;hey fam!&quot; takes on a whole new meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into fast-paced action, fight to survive, and uncover the cause of all this madness. Get ready for a hefty dose of humor and punchy one-liners in the heat of battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/3cdd51a74790acc185f838bbb67d6303.avif?t=1748593732\" width=488 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong><br>Wreak havoc in co-op mode \u2013 it\u2019s always better with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mode</strong><br>Just want some quick chaos? Jump into solo or co-op survival and go full send!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of zombie influencers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Easter eggs &amp; meme-worthy humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of chaos and satisfying destruction</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/953584b88bba5effc113cdec70a3ff3d.webp?t=1748593732\" width=739 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a wild top-down shooter where influencers tried to launch the most insane viral prank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They just didn\u2019t expect one thing \u2013 <strong>you</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/daabd681b7753b1d761b35e4a8003d98.poster.avif?t=1748593732\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/daabd681b7753b1d761b35e4a8003d98.webm?t=1748593732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/daabd681b7753b1d761b35e4a8003d98.mp4?t=1748593732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Prankocalypse</strong>, social media celebs copy each other so much that, in their desperate chase for likes and subs, they\u2019ve turned into <strong>zombie-celebrities</strong>. One viral hit \u2013 hundreds of clones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/b2660388c8c72f4a1af7c5f9676bb030.poster.avif?t=1748593732\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/b2660388c8c72f4a1af7c5f9676bb030.webm?t=1748593732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/b2660388c8c72f4a1af7c5f9676bb030.mp4?t=1748593732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a supermarket security guard, you're stuck on the worst shift of your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie pranksters? Absolutely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying products and chaos? Of course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Easter eggs and absurd humor? You better believe it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Prankocalypse</strong> \u2013 a game where &quot;hey fam!&quot; takes on a whole new meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into fast-paced action, fight to survive, and uncover the cause of all this madness. Get ready for a hefty dose of humor and punchy one-liners in the heat of battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567070/extras/3cdd51a74790acc185f838bbb67d6303.avif?t=1748593732\" width=488 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong><br>Wreak havoc in co-op mode \u2013 it\u2019s always better with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mode</strong><br>Just want some quick chaos? Jump into solo or co-op survival and go full send!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of zombie influencers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Easter eggs &amp; meme-worthy humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of chaos and satisfying destruction</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "When the world was flooded with like-hungry zombies, he stood guard over the market. Boris &quot;Titan&quot; Steel \u2013 the last line of defense against viral annihilation. Prankocalypse \u2013 absurd action that cleans the internet like a router reset.",
